1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,846
Here is how the rest of this series works.

2
00:00:01,869 --> 00:00:06,628
There is one deck for each of Matthew&#8217;s twenty-eight chapters, and this introduction.

3
00:00:07,070 --> 00:00:10,890
Every verse is there, in the Berean Standard Bible, which is public domain.

4
00:00:11,401 --> 00:00:17,903
Each verse appears on its own click, and only the verses are read aloud. Verse numbers, headings and footnotes stay in the notes.

5
00:00:18,228 --> 00:00:22,106
And the slide titles are the translators&#8217; own section headings, not ours.

